return {h=16,w=550,cr=90,hc=15,bh=70,gr="medium",eg={"flying"},st={75,80,70,65,75,90},ab={{39,0},{151,1}},genus={en="Bat Pokémon",es="Pokémon Murciélago",pt="Pokémon Morcego"},flavor={en={[1]="Once it strikes, it will not stop draining energy from the victim even if it gets too heavy to fly.",[2]="Once it strikes, it will not stop draining energy from the victim even if it gets too heavy to fly.",[3]="It attacks in a stealthy manner, without warning. Its sharp fangs are used to bite and suck blood.",[4]="However hard its victim's hide may be, it punctures with sharp fangs and gorges itself with blood.",[5]="It can drink more than 10 ounces of blood at once. If it has too much, it gets heavy and flies clumsily.",[6]="When it plunges its fangs into its prey, it instantly draws and gulps down more than ten ounces of blood.",[7]="GOLBAT loves to drink the blood of living things. It is particularly active in the pitch black of night. This Pokémon flits around in the night skies, seeking fresh blood.",[8]="GOLBAT bites down on prey with its four fangs and drinks the victim’s blood. It becomes active on inky dark moonless nights, flying around to attack people and Pokémon.",[9]="Its fangs easily puncture even thick animal hide. It loves to feast on the blood of people and Pokémon. It flits about in darkness and strikes from behind.",[10]="It clamps down on its prey with needle-sharp fangs and drains over 10 ounces of blood in one gulp.",[11]="Once it bites, it will not stop draining energy from the victim even if it gets too heavy to fly.",[12]="It loves the blood of humans and Pokémon. It flies around at night in search of neck veins.",[13]="Once it starts sucking blood, it does not stop until it is full. It flies at night in search of prey.",[14]="Its sharp fangs puncture the toughest of hides and have small holes for greedily sucking blood.",[15]="However hard its victim’s hide may be, it punctures with sharp fangs and gorges itself with blood.",[16]="It can drink more than 10 ounces of blood at once. If it has too much, it gets heavy and flies clumsily.",[17]="Its sharp fangs puncture the toughest of hides and have small holes for greedily sucking blood.",[18]="Its sharp fangs puncture the toughest of hides and have small holes for greedily sucking blood.",[21]="Flitting around in the dead of night, it sinks its fangs into its prey and drains a nearly fatal amount of blood.",[22]="Flitting around in the dead of night, it sinks its fangs into its prey and drains a nearly fatal amount of blood.",[23]="Once it bites, it will not stop draining energy from the victim even if it gets too heavy to fly.",[24]="Once it starts sucking blood, it does not stop until it is full. It flies at night in search of prey.",[25]="Golbat loves to drink the blood of living things. It is particularly active in the pitch black of night. This Pokémon flits around in the night skies, seeking fresh blood.",[26]="Golbat bites down on prey with its four fangs and drinks the victim’s blood. It becomes active on inky dark moonless nights, flying around to attack people and Pokémon.",[27]="Its thick fangs are hollow like straws, making them unexpectedly fragile. These fangs are specialized for sucking blood.",[28]="Sometimes they drink so much blood, they can’t fly anymore. Then they fall to the ground and become food for other Pokémon.",[29]="Every once in a while, you’ll see a Golbat that’s missing some fangs. This happens when hunger drives it to try biting a Steel-type Pokémon.",[30]="They can suck down over 10 ounces of blood in one go. They have been known to drink so much blood that they can no longer fly.",[31]="It attacks in a stealthy manner, without warning. Its sharp fangs are used to bite and to suck blood.",[32]="It attacks in a stealthy manner, without warning. Its sharp fangs are used to bite and to suck blood.",[33]="It loves to drink other creatures’ blood. It’s said that if it finds others of its kind going hungry, it sometimes shares the blood it’s gathered.",[34]="Its feet are tiny, but this Pokémon walks skillfully. It sneaks up on sleeping prey before sinking in its fangs and slurping up blood.",[39]="It sinks its sharp fangs into other creatures and slurps up their blood. A closer look at the fangs reveals that they are hollow and akin to straws."},es={[23]="Cuando ataque, seguirá chupando energía de su víctima, aunque pese tanto que ya no pueda volar.",[24]="Cuando chupa sangre, no para hasta hartarse. Por la noche sale volando a la caza de presas.",[25]="A Golbat le encanta chuparles la sangre a los seres vivos. Este Pokémon es más activo en la oscuridad de la noche. Es al caer la noche cuando sale a revolotear y a buscar sangre fresca.",[26]="Golbat derriba a sus víctimas mordiéndoles con los cuatro colmillos que tiene y chupándoles la sangre. Solo entra en acción en las noches sin luna. Revolotea en la oscuridad para atacar a Pokémon y personas.",[27]="Succiona la sangre de sus presas con sus gruesos colmillos, que son huecos por dentro a modo de caña y más frágiles de lo que parecen.",[28]="A veces chupa tanta sangre que es incapaz de volar y cae al suelo para acabar siendo presa de otros Pokémon.",[29]="En ocasiones se ven ejemplares a los que les falta algún colmillo por haber intentado morder a un Pokémon de tipo Acero, presas del hambre.",[30]="Es capaz de ingerir 300 cc de sangre de una sentada. A veces chupa tanta que es incapaz de volar.",[31]="Tras aproximarse sigilosamente a su objetivo, utiliza sus afilados colmillos para chuparle la sangre.",[32]="Tras aproximarse sigilosamente a su objetivo, utiliza sus afilados colmillos para chuparle la sangre.",[33]="Le encanta chuparles la sangre a los seres vivos. En ocasiones comparte la preciada colecta con otros congéneres hambrientos.",[34]="Camina con soltura sobre sus pequeñas patas. Se acerca con sigilo a su presa mientras esta duerme y le clava los colmillos para chuparle la sangre."},pt="Crava as presas afiadas em outras criaturas e suga o sangue delas. Olhando de perto, as presas são ocas, como canudos."},evo={{s=41},{s=42,from=41,c={{t="level-up",lv=22}}},{s=169,from=42,c={{t="level-up",happy=160}}}},moves={[1]={1,141,1,103,1,44,10,48,15,44,21,109,32,17,43,114},[2]={1,141,1,103,1,44,10,48,15,44,21,109,32,17,43,114},[3]={1,103,1,141,1,48,6,48,12,44,19,109,30,17,42,212,55,114},[4]={1,103,1,141,1,48,6,48,12,44,19,109,30,17,42,212,55,114},[5]={1,103,1,141,1,48,1,310,6,48,11,310,16,44,21,17,28,109,35,314,42,212,49,305,56,114},[6]={1,103,1,141,1,48,1,310,6,48,11,310,16,44,21,17,28,109,35,314,42,212,49,305,56,114},[7]={1,103,1,141,1,310,1,48,6,310,11,48,16,44,21,17,28,109,35,314,42,212,49,305,56,114},[8]={1,103,1,141,1,48,1,310,5,48,9,310,13,44,17,17,21,109,27,314,33,212,39,305,45,114,51,403},[9]={1,103,1,141,1,48,1,310,5,48,9,310,13,44,17,17,21,109,27,314,33,212,39,305,45,114,51,403},[10]={1,103,1,141,1,48,1,310,5,48,9,310,13,44,17,17,21,109,27,314,33,212,39,305,45,114,51,403},[11]={1,103,1,141,1,48,1,310,5,48,9,310,13,44,17,17,21,109,27,314,33,212,39,512,45,305,51,114,57,403},[12]={1,103,1,141,1,48,1,310,6,48,11,310,16,44,21,17,28,109,35,314,42,212,49,305,56,114},[13]={1,103,1,141,1,48,1,310,6,48,11,310,16,44,21,17,28,109,35,314,42,212,49,305,56,114},[14]={1,103,1,141,1,48,1,310,4,48,8,310,12,44,15,17,19,109,24,129,28,314,33,512,38,212,42,305,47,114,52,403},[15]={1,103,1,141,1,48,1,310,4,48,8,310,12,44,15,17,19,109,24,129,28,314,33,512,38,212,42,305,47,114,52,403},[16]={1,103,1,141,1,48,1,310,1,44,5,48,7,310,11,44,13,17,17,109,19,314,24,129,27,305,32,212,35,512,40,114,43,474,48,403,51,501},[17]={1,103,1,71,1,48,1,310,1,44,5,48,7,310,11,44,13,17,17,109,19,314,24,129,27,305,32,212,35,141,40,114,43,474,48,403,51,501},[18]={1,103,1,71,1,48,1,310,1,44,5,48,7,310,11,44,13,17,17,109,19,314,24,129,27,305,32,212,35,141,40,114,43,474,48,403,51,501},[19]={0,242,1,242,1,18,1,98,1,71,1,48,1,17,1,44,4,17,8,44,12,129,17,109,20,114,31,141,40,92,51,403},[20]={1,103,1,71,1,48,1,310,1,212,15,305,20,501,27,314,34,44,41